WEBVTT

00:00:01.590 --> 00:00:03.660
My name is Taiki Kudou.

00:00:03.660 --> 00:00:07.100
I was taken to this mysterious 
place called the Digital World,

00:00:07.100 --> 00:00:08.920
where I met Shoutmon

00:00:08.920 --> 00:00:11.790
and the other creatures of 
this world, called Digimon.

00:00:12.310 --> 00:00:15.230
This world is having a lot of trouble

00:00:15.230 --> 00:00:16.330
with the attacking Bagra Army.

00:00:16.330 --> 00:00:20.330
<b>Team Bagra</b>

00:00:16.330 --> 00:00:20.330
<b>Enemy?                          The battle begins!                      Enemy</b>

00:00:16.330 --> 00:00:20.330
<b>Team ?             Xros Heart(Team Taiki)     Team Kiriha</b>

00:00:16.330 --> 00:00:20.330
Mysterious                                               Protagonist                                                              Rival
Girl

00:00:16.330 --> 00:00:20.330
<b>Enemy?                                Enemy?
Ally?                                     Ally?</b>

00:00:21.430 --> 00:00:26.300
We were sent to the Heaven Zone, 
a beautiful world full of artwork,

00:00:26.300 --> 00:00:29.270
but we ended up getting arrested 
by their overly strict police force.

00:00:29.850 --> 00:00:33.610
With the help of Lucemon, a Digimon 
who wants to improve this Zone,

00:00:33.610 --> 00:00:37.270
we taught the president, 
SlashAngemon, a lesson,

00:00:37.270 --> 00:00:39.420
but the real problem had just begun.

00:00:42.140 --> 00:00:50.660
<b>The Black Knight Digimon Appears!</b>

00:00:44.230 --> 00:00:46.750
The Black Knight Digimon Appears!

00:00:51.330 --> 00:00:52.660
Citizens,

00:00:53.520 --> 00:00:58.060
please forgive our police force 
for their violent history.

00:00:58.610 --> 00:01:00.500
I will not wait for the election.

00:01:00.500 --> 00:01:02.560
I will relinquish the office of president

00:01:02.560 --> 00:01:04.340
to the kind-hearted Lucemon.

00:01:04.340 --> 00:01:06.030
Agreed!

00:01:06.030 --> 00:01:07.710
Hooray for our new president!

00:01:08.110 --> 00:01:10.030
Hooray for Lucemon!

00:01:12.820 --> 00:01:15.790
So Lucemon is the new president.

00:01:15.790 --> 00:01:18.820
His dream will come true! That's great!

00:01:18.820 --> 00:01:21.230
Where's the guest of honor, anyway?

00:01:21.230 --> 00:01:24.330
We should look for him.

00:01:27.260 --> 00:01:29.530
Looks like this Zone will find peace

00:01:29.530 --> 00:01:31.850
without us having to fight.

00:01:31.850 --> 00:01:33.840
Thanks to Lucemon.

00:01:35.040 --> 00:01:37.240
Hey, Lucemon!

00:01:37.700 --> 00:01:39.330
So this is where you've been!

00:01:39.330 --> 00:01:41.380
What are you doing? 
Everyone's looking for you!

00:01:41.380 --> 00:01:42.880
I'm sorry.

00:01:42.880 --> 00:01:45.830
I usually study here 
at this hour every day,

00:01:45.830 --> 00:01:46.580
and it's become a habit.

00:01:47.100 --> 00:01:48.620
You study every day?

00:01:48.620 --> 00:01:49.410
Yes.

00:01:49.410 --> 00:01:52.850
But I've read all the 
books in this library,

00:01:52.850 --> 00:01:55.010
so I don't need to anymore.

00:01:55.600 --> 00:01:58.600
You've read all these books?

00:01:58.600 --> 00:02:00.800
There you are! Lucemon!

00:02:00.800 --> 00:02:03.230
Yes, I'll be right there.

00:02:04.300 --> 00:02:09.200
Hey, Starmon, the president is 
like the King of this Zone, right?

00:02:09.200 --> 00:02:10.680
That's right, Brother.

00:02:10.680 --> 00:02:11.840
I had no idea!

00:02:12.290 --> 00:02:15.580
You have to study to become King?!

00:02:15.580 --> 00:02:20.290
I'd fall asleep after reading 
just one page of these books!

00:02:20.290 --> 00:02:21.870
Good point.

00:02:21.870 --> 00:02:25.560
He's so amazing...

00:02:27.190 --> 00:02:30.270
Hey, what are you staring at?

00:02:30.270 --> 00:02:31.750
The truth.

00:02:33.500 --> 00:02:36.250
He's still got that nasty look in his eyes.

00:02:36.250 --> 00:02:37.700
I don't trust him.

00:02:44.410 --> 00:02:47.010
Your heart has attained 
an impeccable shine.

00:02:47.010 --> 00:02:49.350
You have the support of all our citizens.

00:02:49.350 --> 00:02:51.780
It is time for the ritual of succession.

00:02:57.820 --> 00:02:59.520
Greetings.

00:03:02.890 --> 00:03:04.300
I knew it!

00:03:04.300 --> 00:03:07.760
You really are some creep who's out to 
disrupt the Heaven Zone's peace!

00:03:07.760 --> 00:03:09.100
Darn you!

00:03:09.100 --> 00:03:10.000
Wait, Shoutmon!

00:03:12.800 --> 00:03:14.860
How can I wait?!

00:03:14.860 --> 00:03:17.590
Lucemon's been working 
so hard for this day!

00:03:17.590 --> 00:03:18.580
I won't let you interfere!

00:03:18.870 --> 00:03:20.810
No, wait! This is...

00:03:23.550 --> 00:03:25.450
The electoral commissioner!

00:03:25.450 --> 00:03:27.970
All of you, show some respect!

00:03:31.460 --> 00:03:36.110
Indeed. I am the 
commissioner, Shakkoumon.

00:03:39.980 --> 00:03:41.500
He's actually a good guy?

00:03:42.040 --> 00:03:43.770
Yes, I am.

00:03:44.250 --> 00:03:46.160
I am the only one who can give

00:03:46.160 --> 00:03:50.640
the next president this armband 
symbolizing the presidency.

00:03:52.910 --> 00:03:54.810
R-Really? Gosh...

00:03:54.810 --> 00:03:56.170
"Gosh," nothing!

00:03:56.170 --> 00:03:57.080
You jumped to the wrong conclusion.

00:03:57.080 --> 00:04:00.180
That explains why he was 
watching us from the shadows!

00:04:00.180 --> 00:04:03.780
Lucemon, I have seen all your actions.

00:04:03.780 --> 00:04:06.600
From your kind heart to 
your diligent studies,

00:04:06.600 --> 00:04:08.740
you are the undisputed winner.

00:04:08.740 --> 00:04:10.090
Thank you.

00:04:10.540 --> 00:04:13.100
I never would've guessed you 
were someone so important.

00:04:13.570 --> 00:04:15.260
After each election,

00:04:15.260 --> 00:04:17.460
the Code Crown secretly 
chooses the next candidates,

00:04:17.460 --> 00:04:20.460
and I observe them to make 
sure they are not evil.

00:04:20.460 --> 00:04:22.970
That is my job.

00:04:22.970 --> 00:04:25.940
That is why I concealed 
my identity. I'm sorry.

00:04:27.580 --> 00:04:30.650
<i>This Zone's Code Crown 
is protected by a seal.</i>

00:04:30.650 --> 00:04:34.290
<i>It can only be broken 
using a special method.</i>

00:04:34.660 --> 00:04:36.750
The sealed Code Crown...

00:04:36.750 --> 00:04:39.690
I will now present you with the armband.

00:04:39.690 --> 00:04:41.770
Congratulations!

00:04:43.130 --> 00:04:44.860
<i>Why would Lucemon make a face like that?</i>

00:04:46.700 --> 00:04:49.000
All right! Way to go!

00:04:49.000 --> 00:04:50.320
Hooray for Lucemon!

00:04:54.570 --> 00:04:58.210
This is a weight off my shoulders.

00:04:58.210 --> 00:05:02.610
The one to lead the Heaven 
Zone must not be evil.

00:05:03.250 --> 00:05:04.900
Please forgive me.

00:05:04.900 --> 00:05:07.500
Even if it was to keep the 
Bagra Army at a distance,

00:05:07.500 --> 00:05:12.190
I myself am not sure why I was so harsh.

00:05:12.190 --> 00:05:13.970
You couldn't help it.

00:05:13.970 --> 00:05:16.700
This paradise is not just 
a paradise, after all.

00:05:20.290 --> 00:05:22.070
Lucemon, what's wrong?

00:05:24.840 --> 00:05:27.890
If an evil leader obtains the Code Crown,

00:05:27.890 --> 00:05:31.350
the seal will break and the ultimate 
dark power will be unleashed.

00:05:31.350 --> 00:05:35.800
That is why we need a 
leader with a just heart.

00:05:35.800 --> 00:05:38.550
I know. I have studied all this.

00:05:39.850 --> 00:05:43.960
I look forward to seeing 
this ultimate dark power.

00:05:46.790 --> 00:05:50.810
Heldicana... wydelca... helbotom...

00:05:53.950 --> 00:05:56.660
That's the incantation to 
break the seal! How do you...

00:05:57.700 --> 00:06:00.110
Wydelca... helbotom...

00:06:00.110 --> 00:06:02.340
By order of your leader...

00:06:02.340 --> 00:06:04.210
Appear to me, Code Crown!

00:06:04.560 --> 00:06:05.810
S-So he's really...

00:06:11.080 --> 00:06:14.320
No way! An earthquake here in the sky?!

00:06:44.330 --> 00:06:47.280
That looks like another shrine!

00:06:47.280 --> 00:06:49.660
What is that weird light?

00:06:49.660 --> 00:06:52.590
An airborne shrine? Now I get it.

00:06:52.590 --> 00:06:55.260
The Code Crown is in there, 
isn't it, Lucemon?!

00:06:57.480 --> 00:06:59.760
So you figured it out.

00:06:59.760 --> 00:07:02.930
You are surprisingly shrewd, Taiki.

00:07:02.930 --> 00:07:05.390
What are you talking about, Lucemon?

00:07:05.390 --> 00:07:07.130
Have you lost your mind?

00:07:07.130 --> 00:07:08.920
I don't want to believe it...

00:07:08.920 --> 00:07:11.380
But that's his true self, Shoutmon.

00:07:11.750 --> 00:07:14.950
He's been acting like a 
good guy all this time

00:07:14.950 --> 00:07:17.020
so he could get the Code Crown.

00:07:17.020 --> 00:07:18.270
Correct.

00:07:18.270 --> 00:07:20.790
I never knew where the 
electoral commissioner

00:07:20.790 --> 00:07:22.050
might be watching from.

00:07:27.530 --> 00:07:30.160
Wh-What is he thinking,

00:07:30.160 --> 00:07:33.600
calling forth the dark shrine in the sky?

00:07:35.470 --> 00:07:37.070
The Code Crown!

00:07:40.390 --> 00:07:42.420
It's finally mine.

00:07:42.420 --> 00:07:44.820
I'm so tired of the good boy routine.

00:07:44.820 --> 00:07:46.680
Even my shoulders are stiff.

00:07:46.680 --> 00:07:49.760
I suppose I'll return 
to my original form now.

00:08:03.660 --> 00:08:05.730
H-He looks like he'd be 
a hit with the ladies...

00:08:05.730 --> 00:08:07.730
But he's not cute anymore...

00:08:08.150 --> 00:08:10.960
This is my true form.

00:08:10.960 --> 00:08:14.540
A servant to Lilithmon of the Bagra Army.

00:08:19.010 --> 00:08:21.580
Bagra... Army?!

00:08:21.580 --> 00:08:23.460
He's made his move.

00:08:23.460 --> 00:08:25.280
Well done, Lucemon.

00:08:25.280 --> 00:08:29.270
Now I'll have the upper hand 
on Tactimon and Blastmon.

00:08:31.900 --> 00:08:36.340
Lady Lilithmon has ordered 
me to eliminate you all.

00:08:36.740 --> 00:08:40.140
But I made good use of you first...

00:08:40.140 --> 00:08:44.450
To topple the police force and 
earn the support of the citizens.

00:08:44.450 --> 00:08:47.640
So all of that before was just an act?!

00:08:48.010 --> 00:08:51.690
All the hard work you did 
to become their leader...

00:08:51.690 --> 00:08:52.400
Everything?!

00:08:52.400 --> 00:08:54.280
Brilliant acting, wasn't it?

00:08:55.630 --> 00:08:57.340
Why, you...

00:08:57.340 --> 00:08:59.200
I thought you were so admirable,

00:08:59.200 --> 00:09:02.090
someone I could really respect!

00:09:02.390 --> 00:09:04.380
Everyone in this Zone felt the same way,

00:09:04.380 --> 00:09:06.530
and gave you that heart you wear!

00:09:08.520 --> 00:09:10.250
You won't get away with that!

00:09:11.900 --> 00:09:13.340
Shoutmon!

00:09:13.340 --> 00:09:15.560
I can't move...

00:09:15.560 --> 00:09:18.020
That's enough, Xros Heart.

00:09:18.020 --> 00:09:19.300
Th-That voice...

00:09:23.890 --> 00:09:25.080
A Digimon?

00:09:27.110 --> 00:09:28.550
Nene!

00:09:28.550 --> 00:09:30.620
Th-That's a scary looking Digimon...

00:09:30.620 --> 00:09:33.020
Who are you?

00:09:33.490 --> 00:09:35.190
As you can see...

00:09:35.800 --> 00:09:38.020
I am but a mere noble.

00:09:39.540 --> 00:09:43.180
The monsters born in the 
Digital realm: Digimon.

00:09:43.180 --> 00:09:45.670
They may be made up of data,

00:09:45.670 --> 00:09:50.570
but they're our precious friends 
who cry, laugh, and fight for us.

00:09:50.570 --> 00:09:52.640
Join us in our world of adventure

00:09:52.980 --> 00:09:56.210
as we gather lots more teammates!

00:09:56.210 --> 00:09:57.280
DigiXros!

00:11:24.300 --> 00:11:28.030
That knight is evil! Too evil!

00:11:38.650 --> 00:11:39.920
Are you all right?

00:11:39.920 --> 00:11:40.850
Thank you.

00:11:41.220 --> 00:11:43.070
Perfect timing.

00:11:43.070 --> 00:11:47.780
The incantation you taught 
me worked perfectly.

00:11:49.550 --> 00:11:52.360
Nene! You've been helping the Bagra Army?!

00:11:54.130 --> 00:11:55.340
Answer me!

00:11:55.340 --> 00:11:56.690
Who is that black knight?!

00:11:57.540 --> 00:11:59.510
This is your warning, Taiki.

00:11:59.510 --> 00:12:03.300
Quietly watch what we are about 
to do, and don't interfere.

00:12:04.240 --> 00:12:08.560
If you do, I will have to battle you...

00:12:09.040 --> 00:12:10.510
as a General.

00:12:11.710 --> 00:12:13.770
Nene is a General?!

00:12:13.770 --> 00:12:17.300
No way! Nene, the idol of my heart?!

00:12:17.300 --> 00:12:19.220
This is a dark day...

00:12:19.220 --> 00:12:22.100
He can only watch, 
whether he likes it or not, Nene.

00:12:22.100 --> 00:12:25.120
As you reported, Shoutmon is the basis

00:12:25.120 --> 00:12:27.400
of Xros Heart's DigiXros.

00:12:27.800 --> 00:12:31.500
After taking my attack, he won't 
be able to stand for some time.

00:12:31.500 --> 00:12:34.410
I'm showing you mercy, Taiki Kudou.

00:12:34.410 --> 00:12:38.740
There may still be things 
you can do for us.

00:12:42.140 --> 00:12:43.660
Lucemon.

00:12:43.660 --> 00:12:48.710
As promised, we will take the 
dark power of the shrine.

00:12:48.710 --> 00:12:52.150
You may do as you please 
with the Code Crown.

00:12:52.150 --> 00:12:55.950
Of course, this is all I wanted.

00:12:55.950 --> 00:12:58.840
Then I'll get started. Reload, Sparrowmon.

00:13:02.000 --> 00:13:03.290
You called, Nene?

00:13:03.290 --> 00:13:05.460
Fly, Sparrowmon.

00:13:07.100 --> 00:13:08.700
She can't! Nene!

00:13:10.760 --> 00:13:11.800
Shoutmon!

00:13:11.800 --> 00:13:14.030
Hang in there, Shoutmon!

00:13:14.490 --> 00:13:16.450
It serves you right, little worms.

00:13:16.450 --> 00:13:18.850
I don't even need to fight you myself.

00:13:18.850 --> 00:13:22.050
And look, the Zone is looking splendid.

00:13:23.380 --> 00:13:25.420
Wh-What's wrong with all of you?

00:13:25.420 --> 00:13:27.630
I feel all irritated somehow...

00:13:27.630 --> 00:13:29.820
It feels terrible!

00:13:30.190 --> 00:13:32.170
My heart is grinding...

00:13:32.170 --> 00:13:35.490
Your heart is... grinding?

00:13:35.490 --> 00:13:39.360
The black aura only reaches 
the pure hearts of Digimon.

00:13:39.360 --> 00:13:42.930
They have begun to draw out 
the power of the shrine.

00:13:46.570 --> 00:13:49.410
Dark power is pouring out.

00:13:49.410 --> 00:13:51.320
It's making me dizzy...

00:13:51.320 --> 00:13:52.140
Dizzy, indeed!

00:13:52.140 --> 00:13:55.450
Nene, put me in your Xros Loader

00:13:55.450 --> 00:13:57.780
and absorb this power into it.

00:14:02.360 --> 00:14:05.380
Good, good. This is excellent power.

00:14:05.380 --> 00:14:06.990
We'll take it with us.

00:14:06.990 --> 00:14:09.610
Oh dear, it's starting 
to leak to the outside.

00:14:09.610 --> 00:14:13.800
No matter. I seek evil of 
high quality, not quantity.

00:14:33.220 --> 00:14:34.740
This is it!

00:14:34.740 --> 00:14:37.730
This is the dark feeling 
that instilled evil in us!

00:14:39.130 --> 00:14:42.490
What is this aura? 
What's happening to them?

00:14:42.490 --> 00:14:45.310
This paradise is not just a paradise.

00:14:46.230 --> 00:14:51.380
That's right. This world has been 
hiding a tremendous dark power...

00:14:51.380 --> 00:14:53.470
within that shrine.

00:14:53.470 --> 00:14:57.410
The Code Crown and the pure hearts 
of the citizens kept it at bay.

00:14:57.700 --> 00:15:01.880
<i>So that's why this Zone was 
excessively beautiful and pure!</i>

00:15:01.880 --> 00:15:06.130
What a deranged noble, 
to desire such a power.

00:15:07.390 --> 00:15:09.300
They have the dark power,

00:15:09.300 --> 00:15:11.920
and I have the Code Crown.

00:15:11.920 --> 00:15:14.490
It's a matter of give and take.

00:15:16.090 --> 00:15:20.990
Now, I suppose I'll take 
this back to Lady Lilithmon.

00:15:24.370 --> 00:15:26.170
No, you won't!

00:15:26.170 --> 00:15:28.340
What do you think you're doing now?!

00:15:30.220 --> 00:15:33.180
You think we're going to 
let you go, you impostor?

00:15:33.180 --> 00:15:34.360
This aura is nothing!

00:15:34.360 --> 00:15:36.310
We'll strike you down for Brother!

00:15:36.310 --> 00:15:37.280
You'll pay!

00:15:37.280 --> 00:15:39.500
You must be desperate 
to die a gruesome death!

00:15:44.590 --> 00:15:46.420
H-He's a demon!

00:15:47.830 --> 00:15:50.130
Don't worry about us! Assist them!

00:15:50.130 --> 00:15:51.630
All right.

00:15:53.300 --> 00:15:55.630
If you leave with the Code Crown,

00:15:55.630 --> 00:15:56.970
won't something terrible happen here?

00:15:56.970 --> 00:15:58.300
I suppose it will.

00:15:58.300 --> 00:16:01.910
All the Digimon of this Zone 
will turn into evil beasts,

00:16:01.910 --> 00:16:04.190
and they'll kill each other 
until not one remains.

00:16:05.440 --> 00:16:08.260
But none of that means a thing to me.

00:16:08.710 --> 00:16:11.830
Nor does it matter to all of you, 
who are about to die!

00:16:11.830 --> 00:16:13.990
Just relax and burn to ashes!

00:16:21.160 --> 00:16:22.430
No! I won't make it!

00:16:26.790 --> 00:16:28.100
Shoutmon!

00:16:28.100 --> 00:16:29.800
What?! How did you...

00:16:30.220 --> 00:16:31.670
You wanna know?

00:16:32.900 --> 00:16:35.200
I bet you wanna know...

00:16:35.200 --> 00:16:38.240
how I'm back on my feet.

00:16:38.240 --> 00:16:42.510
Because your babbling made me so 
mad, I can't feel pain anymore!

00:16:46.200 --> 00:16:49.710
A "king" who sacrifices 
everyone else isn't a king!

00:16:49.710 --> 00:16:52.320
I'll never allow someone like 
that to become a ruler,

00:16:52.320 --> 00:16:54.060
even for a second!

00:16:54.060 --> 00:16:55.090
Shoutmon!

00:16:56.360 --> 00:16:58.760
That's it! That's my Shoutmon!

00:16:58.760 --> 00:17:00.420
You're not like Lucemon!

00:17:00.420 --> 00:17:01.810
You better believe it!

00:17:01.810 --> 00:17:04.600
I'm going to be a real king, 
with you at my side.

00:17:05.130 --> 00:17:06.740
Time to DigiXros, Taiki!

00:17:06.740 --> 00:17:08.420
I won't let you!

00:17:08.420 --> 00:17:10.170
Now, Taiki!

00:17:10.170 --> 00:17:10.980
Right!

00:17:13.240 --> 00:17:14.450
Shoutmon!

00:17:14.450 --> 00:17:15.650
Oh yeah!

00:17:15.650 --> 00:17:17.400
Ballistamon!

00:17:17.400 --> 00:17:18.520
Dorulumon!

00:17:19.050 --> 00:17:19.820
Starmons!

00:17:19.820 --> 00:17:20.590
Yes!

00:17:20.590 --> 00:17:22.090
Beelzebumon!

00:17:24.420 --> 00:17:25.570
DigiXros!

00:17:26.120 --> 00:17:27.730
DigiXros!

00:17:36.530 --> 00:17:39.500
Shoutmon X4B!

00:17:58.200 --> 00:17:59.320
Pest!

00:18:03.230 --> 00:18:04.600
I can't lose!

00:18:04.600 --> 00:18:06.180
Resistance is futile!

00:18:06.180 --> 00:18:07.730
I will win!

00:18:07.730 --> 00:18:10.270
Dead or Alive!

00:18:27.220 --> 00:18:28.840
Aramitama!

00:18:34.210 --> 00:18:36.390
Now is the time, you who have just hearts!

00:18:36.390 --> 00:18:38.340
Shoutmon X4B!

00:18:38.340 --> 00:18:40.550
Strike him with his own attack!

00:18:53.280 --> 00:18:54.610
Chaos Flare!

00:19:00.720 --> 00:19:01.790
All right!

00:19:12.280 --> 00:19:14.250
Thanks, Shakkoumon.

00:19:14.250 --> 00:19:16.750
No, this is my fault.

00:19:16.750 --> 00:19:18.920
My discerning eye as the 
commissioner was lacking.

00:19:19.600 --> 00:19:22.370
Please, go to the airborne shrine

00:19:22.370 --> 00:19:26.630
and use the Code Crown to stop the evil.

00:19:26.630 --> 00:19:29.100
But how do we get up there?

00:19:30.110 --> 00:19:32.580
I will help you.

00:19:54.990 --> 00:19:56.050
Taiki!

00:19:56.050 --> 00:19:57.240
Nene, stop!

00:19:57.240 --> 00:19:59.140
That power will destroy this Zone!

00:19:59.140 --> 00:20:01.870
I know. But you can't stop me.

00:20:01.870 --> 00:20:05.610
Are you on that jerk, Lucemon's, team?!

00:20:05.610 --> 00:20:09.320
What?! Don't talk like that to 
Nene, you jagged little punk!

00:20:09.320 --> 00:20:11.090
Jagged?!

00:20:13.920 --> 00:20:14.660
Nene!

00:20:14.660 --> 00:20:15.700
No!

00:20:15.700 --> 00:20:17.160
Lucemon! You're still...

00:20:17.160 --> 00:20:18.710
That's right!

00:20:18.710 --> 00:20:20.280
If I absorb this evil aura,

00:20:20.280 --> 00:20:22.930
I'll be reborn stronger than ever!

00:20:22.930 --> 00:20:24.540
No! You can't!

00:20:24.540 --> 00:20:25.240
Quiet!

00:20:25.240 --> 00:20:26.870
This alliance is dissolved!

00:20:29.080 --> 00:20:30.680
What?

00:20:30.680 --> 00:20:33.750
The power is being drawn to his evil.

00:20:33.750 --> 00:20:35.560
Interesting.

00:20:35.560 --> 00:20:38.270
Excellent! I can feel the power rising...

00:20:39.440 --> 00:20:41.290
Wh-What is this?!

00:20:41.290 --> 00:20:42.990
I can't contain it!

00:20:48.730 --> 00:20:51.520
Nene!

00:20:52.210 --> 00:20:54.620
<b>To Be Continued</b>

00:20:54.620 --> 00:20:58.140
<b>Digimon Data Collection</b>

00:20:55.320 --> 00:20:58.140
Digimon Data Collection!

00:20:58.140 --> 00:21:02.070
<b>Listen to the Digimon's melody!</b>

00:20:58.540 --> 00:21:02.070
Listen to the melody of 
this Digimon I caught!

00:20:59.070 --> 00:21:00.070
<b>Melody starts in 3 seconds.</b>

00:21:00.070 --> 00:21:01.070
<b>Melody starts in 2 seconds.</b>

00:21:01.070 --> 00:21:02.070
<b>Melody starts in 1 second.</b>

