<b>[Type]</b>

00:21:07.080 --> 00:21:14.490
<b>Hybrid Type</b>

00:21:07.980 --> 00:21:14.490
<b>[Attacks]</b>

00:21:09.510 --> 00:21:14.490
<b>Blue Hawaii Death 
Strawberry Death</b>

00:21:11.450 --> 00:21:14.490
Eating too much ice gives you brain freeze!

00:21:16.050 --> 00:21:18.060
Lucemon has transformed to Satan Mode!

00:21:18.060 --> 00:21:19.790
What do we do?!

00:21:19.790 --> 00:21:21.060
It's Sparrowmon!

00:21:21.060 --> 00:21:23.130
I can sense it... I know it!

00:21:23.130 --> 00:21:25.500
A miraculous new DigiXros 
is about to be born!

00:21:25.500 --> 00:21:27.390
Digimon Xros Wars!

00:21:25.500 --> 00:21:29.320
<b>A Miraculous DigiXros!</b>

00:21:26.600 --> 00:21:29.320
<b>Shoutmon X5 Takes Flight!</b>

00:21:27.390 --> 00:21:29.370
You can't turn your back 
on the next one, either!
